      soft natural daylight.
    longDescription: A slim bottom-freezer refrigerator made for quiet, modern kitchens.
      Its simple vertical shape works well beside dark cabinets, white counters and
      soft natural daylight. The layout keeps fresh food at eye level and places
      frozen storage in the lower section for a cleaner everyday workflow.
    widthText: 60 cm
    heightText: 190 cm
    depthText: 66 cm
    weightText: 72 kg
